// bootstrap: proof_multi_strategy — 多策略证明: 6种(向量/全角/坐标/面积/MCTS/Groebner)

Point proof_multi_strategy:
  vector_proof, full_angle, coordinate, area_method
  mcts_search(state: ProofState) -> ProofStep
  groebner_proof(ideal: PolyIdeal) -> Proof

Constraint proof_multi_strategy:
  each strategy produces valid proofs
  mcts explores with ucb1_policy
  groebner reduction is confluent
  strategies are independent and combinable

Prove;
Normalize;
